lName":"TC-01 Patient Chart Card › TC-01/S04"},"descriptionHtml":"<div class=\"rc-approach\"><p><b>思路 / Approach</b> · TC-01 Patient Chart Card · <b>S04</b> 「每种徽章都会显示在卡片上：New Admission、Consult、Follow-up，两个模式」 <span class=\"notranslate\" translate=\"no\" lang=\"en\">Each badge class shows on the card: New Admission, Consult, Follow-up, both contexts</span></p><p><b>覆盖的 UAT 步骤 / 票 AC：</b></p><ul><li><b>U4</b> The card shows the New Admission / Follow-up / Consult badge.（UAT TC-01；TFA-92579 AC 3）</li></ul><p><b>测试设计方法：</b>等价类（equivalence） — 同一条规则换一类输入（医院 / 养老院、另一种数据）再验一次，每一类都要对。</p><p><b>Given </b>Standard fixture</p><p><b>When </b>In the chart header set Admission status to New Admission, go back to the list; repeat for Consult and Follow-up; then the same for the resident in Nursing Home</p><p><b>Then </b>After each change the list card shows exactly the chosen badge and not the other two</p><p><b>通过的标准（oracle，节选）：</b>oracle.mjs on the list page (no other badge words there): mustContain 'Open chart for &lt;name&gt;' and the chosen badge, mustNotContain the other two. One patient per context, so not evidence for U8; the badge roll is S07</p><p><b>在哪跑：</b>dev 单元 U21；测试方法 AGENT · 浏览器 agent；矩阵里排的车道 浏览器 agent（automated）</p><p><small>S04 是我们自己编的用例号（覆盖矩阵 cases/TC-01.matrix.json 里的编号），不是 UAT 文档里的步骤号。</small></p></div><p><b>环境：dev</b> — dev 部署，build <code>e02167f</code>（Deploy Convex，2026-10-12T18:24:27Z）；账号和地址不写进报告；run folder <code>runs/2026-10-14-dev</code>。</p><p><b>测试方法：</b>AGENT · 浏览器 agent；辅助：PW · Playwright 脚本 — 按 cases/test-methods.json 的分类，分类说在 both 跑；来源：<code>dev</code>。</p><p><b>UAT item:</b> TC-01 Patient Chart Card · <b>Section:</b> A1 · Home Screen &amp; Dashboard · <b>Scenario:</b> TC-01/S04</p><p><b>Each badge class shows on the card: New Admission, Consult, Follow-up, both contexts</b></p><p><b>Tickets:</b> TFA-92579 Home Screen: Patient Chart Card (ready for qa)</p><p><b>Result:</b> Pass from <code>scripts/oracle.mjs</code> on the saved evidence (<code>units/U21.verdict.json</code>), unit U21 split by its parts' checkpoints. Agent: 84 turns, 242 s, $0.68.</p><p><b>Plan:</b> unit U21 (#21, ready-for-qa, ui-only) — Admission badge set by hand. Same legacy seed, same control. TC-06 S11 runs first: its s11-n-list-before checkpoint needs the resident on Follow-up with no Consult / New Admission, which only the fresh legacy seed guarantees. TC-01 S04 then sets every badge itself and saves a checkpoint after each change, so it does not depend on where S11 left the patients. Runs together with TC-06/S11.</p><p><b>Checked by Quinn's runner</b> (<code>ledger.md</code> #21, U21; checked: yes): <b>Pass</b> — badge per chart/context never leaks (S11); all three badge states shown on list cards in both modes (S04)</p>","environment":"default","setup":[],"teardown":[],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["TC-01 Patient Chart Card","S04 Each badge class shows on the card: New Admission, Consult, Follow-up, both contexts"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":[],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"id":"5adbb2bb84a6b90d88770fbd6d8eda46","originalFileName":"bd0997e7-efcf-496b-acaa-cffba4a681ab-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":2538},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"58a4c9eaaafbf0985eaa165840f602fc","originalFileName":"50a7c64d-3eb0-42b1-a3bd-f9f635b82054-attachment.png","ext":".png","contentType":"image/png","contentLength":79188,"name":"screenshot"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"cdf310eae0644aea8fb6ddfe6f8f8928","originalFileName":"85236096-0251-4c97-b266-2ee3ea3742d1-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":2532,"name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"a516664a3320154fd73a27c19e4a04da","originalFileName":"a26ce456-691d-4d75-84ec-cc7afddd5076-attachment.png","ext":".png","name":"screenshot","conte